    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "WALSAS\nLet Scandinavian\ncarry your air mail\nand air freight.\nSCANDINAVIAN AIRLINES SYSTEM\nDanish — Norwegian — Swedish Air Lines\nLet Scandinavian\ncarry your air mail\nand air freight.\nSCANDINAVIAN AIRLINES SYSTEM\nDanish - Norwegian - Swedish Air Lines\nLet Scandinavian\ncarry your air mail\nand air freight.\nSCANDINAVIAN AIRLINES SYSTEM\nDanish - Norwegian — Swedish Air Lines",
      "SAS - Scandinavian Airlines System -\nis the name for a combination of three\nfamous national airlines - those of\nDenmark, Norway and Sweden - who\nhave created a united world traffic and\nservice organisation.\nin the world ready to help you where-\never possible.\nOur already fine fleet has now been in-\ncreased by 17 of\nthe world's most modern aircraft,\nthe DC-6.\nFor you, the passenger,\nThis gives you added advantages for\nthis combine has great advantages, for\nthe price of your ticket because the\nby pooling our resources we now offer\nDC-6 means a faster journey in greater\nyou better service and more comfortable\ncomfort and repose.\nflights on an extended network of air-\nThe aim of the SAS organisation is to pro-\nlines. Moreover you will find our repre-\nvide the best possible service, speed and\nsentatives in most of the largest cities\ncomfort at a price within the reach of all.\nSCANDINAVIAN AIRLINES SYSTEM\nDanish - Norwegian\n- Swedish Air Lines\nScandinavian co-operation\nhas been established between the\nthree northern airlines so as\ngive you, the travellers of the\nskyways, the best service and\ncomfort available in the most eco-\nnomical way.\nTo the farthest points\non earth in the fastest and\nmost comfortable way by\nScandinavian who has re-\npresentatives in the world's\nlargest cities.\n299\nScandinavian service\nmeans perfect orga-\nnisation,\ngood hu-\nmour, gallantry and\nhospitality."
    ],
